'''Polished cinnabar stairs''' are a decorative [[stairs]] variant of [[polished cinnabar]].

== Obtaining ==
=== Breaking ===
Polished cinnabar stairs drop as an item if mined by any [[pickaxe]]. If mined without a pickaxe, they drop nothing.
{{Breaking row|Polished Cinnabar Stairs|Pickaxe|Wood|horizontal=1}}

